00:03:37.175 --> 00:03:39.802
IMF MENYEDIAKAN BANTUAN IKUT PERJANJIAN

53
00:03:42.805 --> 00:03:46.434
THAILAND MENCARI BAILOUT $8 BILION

54
00:03:48.228 --> 00:03:50.897
KILANG KIMIA SIAP DI VIETNAM,
LAGERS DIEKSPORT KE THAILAND

55
00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:52.357
TANAH HIJAU

56
00:03:54.609 --> 00:03:57.403
-Itu bunyi sejuk.
-Bukankah itu di utara?

