115
00:06:47.573 --> 00:06:49.575
Kebaikan.

116
00:06:51.077 --> 00:06:53.204
Hello, Sawaddee Trading.

117
00:06:53.287 --> 00:06:54.747
Ini Go Ma-yong bercakap.

118
00:06:56.582 --> 00:06:58.751
